The root cause is the geo service: its pod is crash-looping and not ready, so search's calls to geo fail and the failure reaches users through frontend's `/hotels` endpoint. I'll write up the answer now.

```json
{
  "root_causes": [
    {
      "service": "geo",
      "fault_kind": "pod_unavailable",
      "evidence": [
        {"kind": "metric", "sql": "SELECT time, attr_k8s_pod_name, metric, value FROM abnormal_metrics WHERE attr_k8s_pod_name='geo-85ff5d94fc-5njsl' AND metric IN ('k8s.container.ready','k8s.container.restarts') ORDER BY time", "claim": "Geo pod reports container not ready (0) with restarts averaging 5.25 for the whole abnormal window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, count(*) AS spans FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='geo' GROUP BY service_name", "claim": "Geo emits no spans in the abnormal window, versus 1161 server spans in the normal window."},
        {"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, count(*) n, avg(duration)/1e6 avg_ms FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='search' AND span_name='geo.Geo/Nearby' GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Search's calls to geo.Geo/Nearby fail about 99.6% of the time, returning in about 0.02 ms."}
      ]
    }
  ],
  "propagation": [
    {"from": "geo", "to": "search", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE span_name IN ('geo.Geo/Nearby','search.Search/Nearby') AND attr_span_kind IN ('Client','Server') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Search's geo client calls and its own Search/Nearby server spans both error at about 99.6%."}]},
    {"from": "search", "to": "frontend", "evidence": [{"kind": "trace", "sql": "SELECT service_name, span_name, attr_span_kind, attr_status_code, attr_http_response_status_code, count(*) n FROM abnormal_traces WHERE service_name='frontend' AND span_name IN ('HTTP /hotels','search.Search/Nearby') GROUP BY ALL", "claim": "Frontend's HTTP /hotels server spans return 500 errors at about 99.6% while search.Search/Nearby calls fail."}]}
  ]
}
```

